-"Apart from that, I'm perfectly calm."
+"แต่ถ้าไม่นับเรื่องปวดหัว ฉันก็สบายดี"
 
 
 
-n "\n\nAfter venting on Rin all that anger that I had bottled inside, it felt like a great weight had been lifted from my heart."
